**Files with no issues found:** `api.size-chart.tsx` (CORS, shop validation, scoping — all correct), `api.analytics-event.tsx` (CORS, shop, event type validation — correct, fire-and-forget pattern correct), `en.default.json` (all keys present), focus trapping logic, keyboard navigation, `prefers-reduced-motion` support, `escapeHtml` XSS protection in widget, localStorage cache TTL, AbortController timeout pattern.

Good — typecheck passes clean. Now I have everything needed for a complete audit. Let me compile all findings.

